Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the per-file list and for every third-party
component, its pinned revision and its license. In short:

  - gamepad worker accepts the Bluetooth standard-gamepad stick layout
    (ABS_Z/RZ) in addition to XInput, and the device-list unpacking that
    terminated the input thread is fixed.
  - gamepad control can be enabled automatically on App start through
    data/gamepad-settings.json.
  - tools/monitor-motion.py samples port 9527 and reports gait stability.
  - docs describe the AI-branch service name, startup enable and monitoring.
  - LICENSE, NOTICE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/ were added.

